debar.</div> </div> </div> </div>I last read the book in November, so it's possible I've forgotten some specifics, but \u2014 yep, <a href=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/4464486/Screen%20Shot%202015-01-14%20at%2010.27.51%20PM.png\" target=\"_blank\">there it is in my chatlogs</a>.<br /> <br /> Comparisons of the highway system to arteries, the cult of auto execs sacrificing people to the assembly line, alien technology in every car, the Mood's &quot;split second of sheer inevitability&quot;\u2026<br /> <br /> Oh, and Road Gospel.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">(Of course, I'm on Asylum now, and <i>damn</i> if that isn't a lot of fours and inadvisably-applied medicine.)</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}